  "bodyHash": "706ec461e5b82a26",
  "content": "\n\n你好世界\n\n這個整合包旨在讓您體驗 MineColonies（一款允許您使用村民建造自己城市的模組），同時如果您願意，還能透過各種科技模組體驗豐富多彩的玩法。<BR>\n包含 Forgematica（建築藍圖）、更多維度（如 Aether）、CAWEZ'S Mantle to Stratus 與 Ad Astra、精美的世界生成（Terratonic）、等待探索的有趣地點、大量全新生物、武器、工具與護甲，並搭配視覺模組、資源包、音樂、音效與光影（透過 Oculus 和 Embeddium）以提升沉浸感。\n\n推薦配置：\n* 64位元 Java（您需要 <a href=\"https://www.oracle.com/java/technologies/javase/jdk17-archive-downloads.html\">Java SE Development Kit 17</a>）\n* 分配 8GB RAM\n\n<details>\n<summary>已知問題與解決方案：</summary>\n<UL>\n<LI><B>Distant Horizons 與光影同時開啟時出現嚴重卡頓</B>：若遇到此情況導致 CPU 佔用率達 100%，請嘗試在 Java 啟動參數中加入以下內容：`-XX:+UseG1GC -Dsun.rmi.dgc.server.gcInterval=2147483646 -XX:+UnlockExperimentalVMOptions -XX:G1NewSizePercent=20 -XX:G1ReservePercent=20 -XX:MaxGCPauseMillis=50 -XX:G1HeapRegionSize=32M`（感謝 \"Noname49237\" 提供此方案。）</LI>\n\n<LI>安裝時出現 \"<B>Invalid Version 47.2.20 for modloader Forge</B>\" 錯誤：此錯誤僅在嘗試於 Modrinth 啟動器安裝整合包時發生。在 Modrinth 修復前，您仍可透過 Prismlauncher 安裝本整合包。</LI>\n\n<LI>若您曾遭遇 <B>快捷鍵重置為模組預設值</B> 的崩潰問題，只需使用「重置所有快捷鍵」按鈕即可恢復為整合包預設設定。</LI>\n\n<LI>來自 **MineTreasure** 的桶子/箱子會**在一定時間後消失**，因此請盡速搜刮或放棄，但在此期間請勿將物品存入其中，除非您能接受它們隨桶子消失而遺失。</LI>\n\n<LI>若想建立 <B>超平坦世界</B>，請先（暫時）停用 Terralith 與 Tectonic 模組，並使用 Chunky 的指令生成所需區塊後，再重新啟用這兩個模組以用於一般世界。（<a href=\"https://github.com/NeosSkopos/ColoniesAndTechnologies/issues/3\">更多資訊</a>）</LI>\n\n<LI>破壞 <B>Slopes from Automobility（Automobility 的斜坡）</B> 可能導致遊戲崩潰。若發生此狀況，切換至創造模式進行破壞應可解決問題。</LI>\n</UL>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>如何架設專用伺服器：</summary>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/krVubnOhKWQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</details>\n\n\n本整合包包含以下內容：\n* <B><U>地圖/小地圖/導航：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/journeymap\">Journeymap</a> & <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mapfrontiers\">MapFrontiers</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/chalk-mod\">Chalk</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/explorers-compass\">Explorer's Compass</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/natures-compass\">Nature's Compass</a>\n* <B><U>地形生成/維度：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/terralith\">Terralith</a> (主世界) & <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/remove-terralith-intro-message\">Remove Terralith Intro Message</a> (移除開場訊息), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/tectonic\">Tectonic</a> (與 Terralith 搭配效果極佳), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/incendium\">Incendium</a> (地獄), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/nullscape\">Nullscape</a> (終界), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aether\">Aether</a> (新維度), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/spelunkery\">Spelunkery</a> (洞穴與礦業), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/subterrestrial\">Subterrestrial</a> (地下建築), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/abridged\">Abridged</a> (跨河橋樑), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-archeology\">Better Archeology</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/plugin/chunky\">Chunky</a> (區塊預載生成), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cawezs-mantle-to-stratus\">CAWEZ'S Mantle to Stratus</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/when-dungeons-arise-seven-seas\">When Dungeons Arise: Seven Seas</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-bridges\">Yungs Bridges</a>\n* <B><U>結構/建築群：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/philips-ruins\">Philips Ruins</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/towers-of-the-wild-modded\">Towers of the wild</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/when-dungeons-arise\">When Dungeons Arise</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mes-moogs-end-structures\">MES - Moog's End Structures</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/idas\">Integrated Dungeons and Structures</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/integrated-stronghold\">Integrated Stronghold</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/better-underwater-ruins\">Hopo better underwater ruins</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/hopo-better-ruined-portals\">Hopo Better Ruined Portals</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/blossom-blade\">Blossom Blade</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-dungeons\">Yungs Better Dungeons</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-end-island\">YUNG's Better End Island</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-jungle-temples\">YUNG's Better Jungle Temples</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-mineshafts\">Yungs Better Mineshafts</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-nether-fortresses\">Yungs Better Nether Fortresses</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-ocean-monuments\">Yungs Better Ocean Monuments</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-witch-huts\">Yungs Better Witch Huts</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/qraftyfied\">qraftyfied</a>, <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-urban\">Abandoned urban</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sparsestructuresreforged\">Sparse Structures Reforged</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create-let-the-adventure-begin\">Create: Let The Adventure Begin</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/medieval-buildings-end-edition\">Medieval Buildings [End Edition]</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/ati-structures-fabricforge\">ATi Structures Mod</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/no-more-villages\">No More Villages</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/no-more-ocean-monuments\">No More Ocean Monuments</a> (原版), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/no-more-ocean-ruins\">No More Ocean Ruins</a> (原版), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/no-more-ruined-portals\">No More Ruined Portals</a> (原版)\n* <B><U>村莊/村民優化：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/integrated-villages\">Integrated Villages</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\">Fresh Animations</a> (動態動畫), <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecolonies\">MineColonies</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/trade-uses\">Trade Uses</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/villager-death-messages\">Villager death messages</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/heyberryshutup\">Hey Berry! SHUT UP</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/villager-names-serilum\">Villager Names</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towntalk\">TownTalk</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/smarter-farmers-farmers-replant\">Smarter Farmers (farmers replant)</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/villager-transportation\">Villager Transportation</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/tidal-towns\">Tidal Towns</a>\n* <B><U>太空探索：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ad-astra/\">Ad Astra</a>\n* <B><U>移動/交通工具：</U></B> 汽車 (<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/automobility\">Automobility</a>), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/travel-anchors\">Travel Anchors</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-climbing\">Better Climbing</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/block-runner\">Block Runner</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hang-glider\">Hang Glider</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">Immersive Aircraft</a> & <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">Man of Many Planes</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/little-logistics\">Little Logistics</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/elevatormod\">ElevatorMod</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hoook\">Hook</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/parcool\">ParCool</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/small-ships\">Small Ships</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/jump-over-fences\">Jump Over Fences</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/air-hop\">Air Hop</a>\n* <B><U>戰鬥：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vics-point-blank\">Vic's Point Blank</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-combat\">Better Combat</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/simply-swords\">Simply Swords</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-tridents\">Better Tridents</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shield-expansion\">Shield Expansion</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mmmmmmmmmmmm\">MmmMmmMmmMmm</a> (目標假人顯示 DPS), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-bows-restrung\">More Bows Restrung</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/landmines\">Landmines</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/spoorn-weapon-attributes\">Spoorn Weapon Attributes</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passive-shield\">Passive Shield</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/simple-spears\">Simple Spears</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/silent-gear\">Silent Gear</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/marbleds-melees\">Marbled's Melees</a>\n* <B><U>工具：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/piercing-paxels\">Piercing Paxels</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tool-upgrades\">Tool Upgrades</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mob-lassos\">Mob Lassos</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/scannable\">Scannable, Artifacts</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/curios\">Curios API</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/mine-treasure\">Mine Treasure</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mekanism-tools\">Mekanism Tools</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crystal-tools\">Crystal Tools</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/silent-gear\">Silent Gear</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/torch-bandolier\">Torch Bandolier</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/advanced-golems\">Advanced Golems</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/liteminer\">Liteminer</a>\n* <B><U>護甲：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/full-turtle-armor\">Full Turtle Armor</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">Immersive Armors</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/useful-slime\">Useful Slime</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/spoorn-armor-attributes\">Spoorn Armor Attributes</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\">Cosmetic Armor Reworked</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/silent-gear\">Silent Gear</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/superior-shields\">Superior Shields</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/marbledsarsenal\">Marbled's Arsenal [MA]</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/armor-of-the-ages\">Armor of the Ages</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/armor-stand-shift-swap\">Armor Stand Shift Swap</a>\n* <B><U>科技：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create\">Create</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ae2\">Applied Energistics 2</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/plenty-plates\">Plenty Plates</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/spiky-spikes\">Spiky Spikes</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mekanism\">Mekanism</a> & <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mekanism-generators\">Mekanism Generators</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/chunk-loaders\">Chunk Loaders</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/security-craft\">Security Craft</a> and <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-protectables\">SecurityCraft: More Protectables</a>\n* <B><U>儲存：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bag-of-holding\">Bag of holding</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\">Easy Shulker Boxes</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/functional-storage\">Functional Storage</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/new-nether-chest\">Nether Chested</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/toms-storage\">Toms Simple Storage Mod</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/travelersbackpack\">Traveler's Backpack</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/echo-chest\">Echo Chest</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/labels\">Storage Labels</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/expanded-storage\">Expanded Storage</a>\n* <B><U>工作站：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ptables\">Portable Tables</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/comforts\">Comforts</a> (睡袋與吊床), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-anvils\">Easy Anvils</a> (防止修理費用無限增長), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/botany-pots\">Botany Pots</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/workshop-for-handsome-adventurer\">Workshop for handsome adventurer</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/universal-sawmill\">Sawmill</a>\n* <B><U>生物：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/alexs-mobs\">Alex's mobs</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/living-things\">Living Things</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ender-zoology\">Ender Zoology</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/guard-villagers\">Guard Villagers</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tiny-skeletons\">Tiny Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\">Bartering station</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/geckolib\">Geckolib</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/naturalist\">Naturalist</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/what-are-you-voting-for-2023\">What Are You Voting For? 2023</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friendly-fire\">Friendly Fire</a> (寵物保護), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/everyxdance\">EveryXDance</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/variants-and-ventures\">Variants & Ventures</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/meowng\">Meowing</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/drodis-slimes\">Drodi's Slimes</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/farsighted-mobs\">Farsighted Mobs (Forge)</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/luminous-monsters\">LUMINOUS: Monsters</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dragns-livestock-overhaul\">DragN’s Livestock Overhaul!</a> and <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dragns-livestock-overhaul-pets-addon!\">DragN's Livestock Overhaul: Pets Addon!</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/zombies-more\">Zombies More</a>\n* <B><U>生活品質（QOL）：</U></B> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/jade\">Jade</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/jei\">JEI</a> (物品管理器), <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/automatic-tool-swap\">Automatic Tools Swap</a>, <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/slot-cycler\">Slot Cycler</a>, <a href=\"https: